Open Vanilla 0032: cast bars for everyone near. A cast with a cast time, or a channel, sends Castline's "CL"
line to the players within 45 yards: "target,<caster>,<spell>,<ms>,<kickable>,,<channel>" to those who have
the caster targeted, "plate,..." to those it is an enemy of; "stop,<role>,<caster>,<1 if interrupted>" when
it ends. OpenVanilla.CastBars (default on). The Casting addon draws them (target bar, nameplates).

